doc:Factsarticle_2026_ICD_Battery dcterms:description "Implantable Cardioverter-Defibrillators (ICDs) are life-sustaining devices; this article reports machine-learning based early detection of ICD battery depletion risk using device interrogation reports, GMM-based data augmentation for training, and five supervised models tested with repeated stratified cross-validation and a held-out test set." .
